#: ../../getting_started/installation/singleNode/centos.rst:2
msgid "Single Node Install on CentOS"
msgstr "Instalação de Nó Único no CentOS"

#: ../../getting_started/additional/morpheusRb.rst:8
#: ../../getting_started/installation/singleNode/centos.rst:4
#: ../../getting_started/installation/singleNode/centos.rst:48
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Nota"

#: ../../getting_started/installation/singleNode/centos.rst:4
msgid ""
"Appliance Package links are available at https://app.morpheushub.com in "
"the downloads section."
msgstr "Os links dos Pacotes do Appliance estão disponíveis em https://app.morpheushub.com na seção de downloads."

#: ../../getting_started/installation/singleNode/centos.rst:7
msgid "Quick Install"
msgstr "Instalação Rápida"

#: ../../getting_started/installation/singleNode/centos.rst:8
msgid "Install the Appliance package and run ``sudo morpheus-ctl reconfigure``."
msgstr "Instale o pacote do Appliance e execute ``sudo morpheus-ctl reconfigure``."

#: ../../getting_started/installation/singleNode/centos.rst:10
msgid ""
"That is it. After the reconfigure completes, |morpheus| will start and be"
" available at ``https://your_machine_name`` in a minute or few."
msgstr "É isso. Após o reconfigure ser concluído, o |morpheus| iniciará e estará disponível em ``https://your_machine_name`` em um minuto ou mais."

#: ../../getting_started/installation/singleNode/centos.rst:13
msgid "Step-by-step Install Instructions"
msgstr "Instruções de Instalação Passo a Passo"

#: ../../getting_started/installation/singleNode/centos.rst:15
msgid "Ensure the |morpheus| Appliance host meets the minimum :ref:`Requirements`"
msgstr "Certifique-se de que o host do Appliance |morpheus| atenda aos :ref:`Requirements` mínimos"

#: ../../getting_started/installation/singleNode/centos.rst:17
msgid ""
"Download the target version ``.rpm`` package for installation in a "
"directory of your choosing. The package can be removed after successful "
"installation."
msgstr "Baixe o pacote ``.rpm`` da versão de destino para instalação em um diretório de sua escolha. O pacote pode ser removido após a instalação bem-sucedida."

#: ../../getting_started/installation/singleNode/centos.rst:19
msgid ""
"wget https://downloads.morpheusdata.com/path/to/morpheus-"
"appliance-$version.rpm"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/installation/singleNode/centos.rst:23
msgid "Validate the package checksum matches source checksums. For example:"
msgstr "Valide se o checksum do pacote corresponde aos checksums de origem. Por exemplo:"

#: ../../getting_started/installation/singleNode/centos.rst:25
msgid "sha256sum morpheus-appliance-$version.rpm"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/installation/singleNode/centos.rst:29
msgid "Next install the rpm package"
msgstr "Em seguida, instale o pacote rpm"

#: ../../getting_started/installation/singleNode/centos.rst:31
msgid "sudo rpm -ihv morpheus-appliance-x.x.x-1.x86_64.rpm"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/installation/singleNode/centos.rst:35
msgid ""
"By default the appliance_url uses the machines hostname, ie "
"``https://your_machine_name``. The default url can be changed by editing "
"``/etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb`` and changing the value of "
"``appliance_url``. Additional Appliance configuration options are "
"available below."
msgstr "Por padrão, o appliance_url usa o hostname da máquina, ou seja, ``https://your_machine_name``. A url padrão pode ser alterada editando ``/etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb`` e alterando o valor de ``appliance_url``. Opções adicionais de configuração do Appliance estão disponíveis abaixo."

#: ../../getting_started/additional/morpheusRb.rst:6
msgid ""
"Morpheus allows for additional advanced customizations for system managed"
" services within the morpheus.rb file located in "
"``/etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb``.  Below is a list of the supported items "
"available in the ``morpheus.rb`` file."
msgstr "O Morpheus permite personalizações avançadas adicionais para serviços gerenciados pelo sistema no arquivo morpheus.rb localizado em ``/etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb``. Abaixo está uma lista dos itens suportados disponíveis no arquivo ``morpheus.rb``."

#: ../../getting_started/additional/morpheusRb.rst:8
msgid ""
"Service configuration settings are not applicable for externalized "
"services such as external MySQL, Elasticsearch or RabbitMQ clusters. Only"
" connection settings are applicable for external services. Additionally, "
"to configure |morpheus| to utilize alternate ports for SSL, you may have "
"to take additional configuration steps. If simply appending a port to "
"your ``appliance_url`` value doesn't work, consult the related article in"
" our `KnowledgeBase <https://support.morpheusdata.com/s/article"
"/Configure-Morpheus-to-utilize-and-alternate-port-for-"
"SSL?language=en_US>`_."
msgstr "As configurações de serviço não se aplicam a serviços externalizados, como clusters externos de MySQL, Elasticsearch ou RabbitMQ. Apenas as configurações de conexão se aplicam a serviços externos. Além disso, para configurar o |morpheus| para utilizar portas alternativas para SSL, você pode precisar tomar etapas de configuração adicionais. Se simplesmente anexar uma porta ao valor de ``appliance_url`` não funcionar, consulte o artigo relacionado em nossa `KnowledgeBase <https://support.morpheusdata.com/s/article/Configure-Morpheus-to-utilize-and-alternate-port-for-SSL?language=en_US>`_."

#: ../../getting_started/additional/morpheusRb.rst:10
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"app['encryption_key_suffix'] = '$suffix'\n"
"  # Replace $suffix with the suffix string of your choice. See "
"`https://docs.morpheusdata.com/en/latest/getting_started/additional/encryption.html`"
" for important details and warnings.\n"
"appliance_url 'https://morpheus.appliance-url.com'\n"
"  # Appending alternate port to appliance_url is supported. ie "
"'https://morpheus.appliance-url.com:8443'\n"
"  # The appliance_url cannot exceed 64 characters\n"
"  # The appliance_url must not contain a trailing `/`.\n"
"\n"
"bitcan['backup_directory'] = '/var/opt/morpheus/bitcan/backups'\n"
"bitcan['working_directory'] = '/var/opt/morpheus/bitcan/working'\n"
"\n"
"firewall['enabled'] = true\n"
"  # When true, reconfigure runs the appliance firewall recipe. On RHEL 7 "
"and later, that recipe disables firewalld and enables appliance-managed "
"iptables.\n"
"firewall['ipv4'] = true\n"
"  # When the firewall recipe is enabled, generate and apply the appliance"
" IPv4 rules. Set firewall['enabled'] = false as well to retain a "
"customer-managed firewall.\n"
"\n"
"elasticsearch['auth_password'] = 'xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx'\n"
"elasticsearch['auth_user'] = 'morpheus-es-user'\n"
"elasticsearch['enable'] = true\n"
"elasticsearch['es_hosts'] = {'127.0.0.1' => 9200}\n"
"elasticsearch['host'] = \"127.0.0.1\"\n"
"elasticsearch['port'] = \"9200\"\n"
"elasticsearch['tmp_dir'] = '/var/tmp/elasticsearch'\n"
"elasticsearch['use_tls'] = false\n"
"↓ The following elasticsearch settings are only valid for "
"Internal/Embedded elasticsearch services\n"
"elasticsearch['log_dir'] = '/var/log/morpheus/elasticsearch'\n"
"elasticsearch['memory_alloc_arena_max'] = 2\n"
"elasticsearch['memory_map_max'] = 65536\n"
"elasticsearch['memory_map_threshold'] = 131072\n"
"elasticsearch['memory_top_pad'] = 131072\n"
"elasticsearch['memory_trim_threshold'] = 131072\n"
"elasticsearch['open_files'] = 204800\n"
"elasticsearch['secure_mode'] = false\n"
"elasticsearch['xms'] = 0.25 #### Configurable for customers running into "
"high memory issues, values are the percentage of total RAM. Both ui and "
"es xms/xmx config only apply if Elasticsearch is enabled.\n"
"elasticsearch['xmx'] = 0.25\n"
"\n"
"guacd['guacamole_enabled'] = false\n"
"guacd['host'] = localhost #### The host guacd is listening on, if not "
"configured 'localhost' is the default value\n"
"\n"
"logging['svlogd_num'] = 30 #### keep 30 rotated log files\n"
"logging['svlogd_size'] = 209715200 #### 200 MB in bytes\n"
"logging['svlogd_timeout'] = 86400 #### rotate after 24 hours in seconds\n"
"\n"
"mysql['enable'] = true\n"
"mysql['host'] = {'127.0.0.1' => 3306}\n"
"mysql['use_tls'] = false\n"
"mysql['morpheus_db_user'] = 'morpheus-db-user'\n"
"mysql['morpheus_password'] = 'morpheus-db-password'\n"
"mysql['morpheus_db'] = 'xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx'\n"
"mysql['mysql_url_overide'] = "
"'jdbc:mysql://10.30.20.10:3306,10.30.20.11:3306,10.30.20.12:3306/morpheusdb?autoReconnect=true&useUnicode=true&characterEncoding=utf8&failOverReadOnly=false&useSSL=false'"
"\n"
"↓ The following mysql settings are only valid for Internal/Embedded mysql"
" services\n"
"mysql['tmp_dir'] = '/tmp/mysql'\n"
"mysql['log_dir'] = '/var/log/morpheus/mysql'\n"
"mysql['max_active'] = 150 # The combined value off all app node "
"max_active values must be lower than max_connections setting in mysql\n"
"mysql['max_connections'] = 151\n"
"mysql['max_allowed_packet'] = 67108864\n"
"mysql['mysql_connect_timeout'] = 60000\n"
"mysql['mysql_max_reconnects'] = 2\n"
"mysql['mysql_queries_before_retry_source'] = 0\n"
"mysql['mysql_seconds_before_retry_source'] = 300\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"nginx['cache_max_size'] = '5000m'\n"
"nginx['enable'] = true\n"
"nginx['loading_pages']['failure_page_h1'] = 'Morpheus Server Error'\n"
"nginx['loading_pages']['failure_page_h2'] = 'Please contact your system "
"administrator for assistance.'\n"
"nginx['loading_pages']['failure_page_title'] = 'Morpheus Server Error'\n"
"nginx['loading_pages']['iteration_time'] = 10000 # milliseconds\n"
"nginx['loading_pages']['loading_page_h1'] = 'Morpheus is Loading...'\n"
"nginx['loading_pages']['loading_page_h2'] = 'please wait'\n"
"nginx['loading_pages']['loading_page_title'] = 'Morpheus Loading'\n"
"nginx['loading_pages']['max_loops'] = 60 # seconds\n"
"nginx['loading_pages']['timeout_page'] = '/timeout.html'\n"
"nginx['loading_pages']['timout_page_h1'] = 'Timeout waiting for Morpheus "
"to load, click below to try again.'\n"
"nginx['loading_pages']['timout_page_title'] = 'Morpheus timeout, please "
"try again...'\n"
"nginx['log_format_name'] = 'custom'\n"
"nginx['log_format'] = '\\'$remote_addr - $remote_user [$time_local] "
"\"$request\" \\' \\'$status $body_bytes_sent \"$http_referer\" \\' "
"\\'\"$http_user_agent\" \"$http_x_forwarded_for\" \\' \\'rt=$request_time"
" uct=\"$upstream_connect_time\" uht=\"$upstream_header_time\" "
"urt=\"$upstream_response_time\"\\';'\n"
"nginx['listen_ipv6'] = nil #### IPv6 will be added to ``morpheus.conf`` "
"and ``morpheus-ssl.conf`` listeners if any value is set in morpheus.rb "
"other than ``nil``, including \"off\" or false\n"
"nginx['ssl_ciphers'] = \"ECDHE-RSA-AES256-GCM-SHA384:ECDHE-RSA-AES128"
"-GCM-SHA256:DHE-RSA-AES256-GCM-SHA384:DHE-RSA-AES128-GCM-SHA256:ECDHE-"
"RSA-AES256-SHA384:ECDHE-RSA-AES128-SHA256:ECDHE-RSA-AES256-SHA:ECDHE-RSA-"
"AES128-SHA:DHE-RSA-AES256-SHA256:DHE-RSA-AES128-SHA256:DHE-RSA-AES256-SHA"
":DHE-RSA-AES128-SHA:ECDHE-RSA-DES-CBC3-SHA:EDH-RSA-DES-CBC3-SHA:AES256"
"-GCM-SHA384:AES128-GCM-"
"SHA256:AES256-SHA256:AES128-SHA256:AES256-SHA:AES128-SHA:DES-"
"CBC3-SHA:HIGH:!aNULL:!eNULL:!EXPORT:!DES:!MD5:!PSK:!RC4\"\n"
"nginx['ssl_company_name'] = \"Morpheus, LLC\"\n"
"nginx['ssl_country_name'] = \"US\"\n"
"nginx['ssl_email_address'] = \"personal@email.com\"\n"
"nginx['ssl_locality_name'] = \"San Mateo\"\n"
"nginx['ssl_organizational_unit_name'] = \"DevOps\"\n"
"nginx['ssl_protocols'] = \"TLSv1 TLSv1.1 TLSv1.2\"\n"
"nginx['ssl_session_cache'] = \"builtin:1000  shared:SSL:10m\"\n"
"nginx['ssl_session_timeout'] = \"5m\"\n"
"nginx['ssl_state_name'] = \"CA\"\n"
"nginx['worker_connections'] = 10240\n"
"nginx['workers'] = integer calculated from number of cpus\n"
"nginx['ssl_access_ping_log'] = false #### false by default, when true GET"
" requests to the ``/ping`` endpoint are logged in the "
"``/var/log/morpheus/nginx/morpheus-ssl-access.log`` file on the appliance"
"\n"
"nginx['access_ping_log'] = false #### false by default, when true GET "
"requests to the ``/ping`` endpoint are logged in the "
"``/var/log/morpheus/nginx/morpheus-ssl-access.log`` file on the appliance"
"\n"
"\n"
"rabbitmq['enable'] = true\n"
"rabbitmq['host'] = '127.0.0.1'\n"
"rabbitmq['port'] = '5672'\n"
"rabbitmq['queue_user_password'] = 'xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx'\n"
"rabbitmq['queue_user'] = 'morpheus-rmq-user'\n"
"rabbitmq['vhost'] = 'morpheus'\n"
"↓ The following rabbitmq settings are only valid for Internal/Embedded "
"rabbitmq services\n"
"rabbitmq['heartbeat'] = nil\n"
"rabbitmq['log_dir'] = '/var/log/morpheus/rabbitmq'\n"
"rabbitmq['nodename'] = 'rabbit@localhost'\n"
"rabbitmq['port'] = '5672'\n"
"rabbitmq['use_tls'] = false\n"
"\n"
"repo['repo_host_url'] = 'https://downloads.morpheusdata.com'\n"
"\n"
"ui['http_client_connect_timeout'] = 10000  #### milliseconds\n"
"ui['jobs_enabled'] = true #### This option disables the appliance jobs "
"service on the appliance node when set to false. This should be disabled "
"only when configuring jobs to run on specific app nodes in HA "
"environments.\n"
"ui['kerberos_config'] = nil\n"
"ui['kerberos_login_config'] = nil\n"
"ui['log_dir'] = '/var/log/morpheus/morpheus-ui'\n"
"ui['max_memory_mb'] = nil\n"
"ui['memory_alloc_arena_max'] = 2\n"
"ui['memory_map_max'] = 65536\n"
"ui['memory_map_threshold'] = 131072\n"
"ui['memory_top_pad'] = 131072\n"
"ui['memory_trim_threshold'] = 131072\n"
"ui['pxe_boot_enabled'] = false #### This option disables the PXE service "
